+        <li><strong>81 Leonard Gallery</strong> — <a href="http://81leonardgallery.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">website ↗</a><span class="meta">81 Leonard  St</span><span class="leg">↓ a few steps to the next stop — about 1 min on foot</span></li>
